 "profile": {
  "paragraphs": [
   "Chorus Innovations sells an operational platform to behavioral health teams for the day to day running of their programs, from crisis response to care coordination and from intake to referrals. The products are sold on their own or brought together, so an agency can start with the piece it needs now.",
   "In crisis work, central dashboards track case activity from intake through dispatch and field care. Mobile staff accept cases, provide live updates and document outcomes on the go. The referral product monitors every case from intake to follow-up on one central dashboard. Care management tracks and coordinates the client journey from intake through discharge.",
   "The company names state agencies, health centers, providers and community behavioral health programs among its users. It states HIPAA and SOC 2 Type II compliance with encryption at every level. The platform is described as created with care coordinators, crisis staff and clinicians."
  ],
  "quote": {
   "text": "The coordination layer behavioral health has been missing",
